      "en": "The LORD said to me, “Take for yourself yet again the equipment of a foolish shepherd.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 내게 이르시되 너는 또 우매한 목자의 기구들을 취할찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "9680343d321ae8ae9757c90e9e22eb350a9ff16e83f01fd9e0ac89998b370732",
      "translation_text_hash": "bea8c10f08692759642f709dc602294d71a5a3e989465e7fd0c95410e5adc2e6",
